{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Kosalavihārin","html":"<article id='thag1.59'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.59 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.59 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Chaṭṭhavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Six </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Kosalavihārittheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Kosalavihārin </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Saddhāyāhaṁ pabbajito, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I went forth out of faith </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>araññe me kuṭikā katā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>and built a hut in the wilderness. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Appamatto ca ātāpī, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’m heedful, ardent, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sampajāno patissato”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>aware, and mindful. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Kosalavihāritthero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
